  decl_forward_err_exported.pcpp - break step of decl_forward.pcpp:
  a forward routine whose full declaration is exported

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\decl_forward_err_exported.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\decl_forward_err_exported.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
